Package: marksight
Architecture: any
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${shlibs:Depends},
Description: minimal, theme-native markdown viewer
 marksight renders Markdown documents with native GTK 4 widgets, following
 the desktop theme automatically — light or dark, Mint-Y or Adwaita — with
 no configuration. It supports CommonMark plus GitHub-flavored tables, task
 lists, footnotes, strikethrough and alerts, watches files for live reload,
 and provides a table of contents and find-in-document.
 .
 Raw HTML in documents is dropped rather than rendered, and the program has
 no JavaScript engine, no network access and no unsafe code.
